{"id":"66d09cd516d4b5e1","group":"62","path":"62/62-thm-ACA-ATR-proper.md","title":"ACA0 Is Strictly Weaker than ATR0","display":"thm-ACA-ATR-proper — ACA0 Is Strictly Weaker than ATR0","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-thm-ACA-ATR-proper","aliases":["62-thm-ACA-ATR-proper"],"display":"thm-ACA-ATR-proper — ACA0 Is Strictly Weaker than ATR0","depends_on":["[[62-df-ACA0]]","[[62-df-ATR0]]","[[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]","[[62-ex-ARITH-not-ATR]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Proposition V.2.5","source_pages":[175],"source_pdf_pages":[193]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-thm-ACA-ATR-proper"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-thm-ACA-ATR-proper</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ACA-ATR-proper — ACA0 Is Strictly Weaker than ATR0"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"35af454d9caa8c9d\" href=\"?note=35af454d9caa8c9d\" title=\"62-df-ACA0\">62-df-ACA0</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cfaecdc022e51c90\" href=\"?note=cfaecdc022e51c90\" title=\"62-df-ATR0\">62-df-ATR0</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"781620ab41bfeebd\" href=\"?note=781620ab41bfeebd\" title=\"62-df-equivalence-over-base\">62-df-equivalence-over-base</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"20465fe6fc759475\" href=\"?note=20465fe6fc759475\" title=\"62-ex-ARITH-not-ATR\">62-ex-ARITH-not-ATR</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Proposition V.2.5"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>175</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>193</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>理论见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"35af454d9caa8c9d\" href=\"?note=35af454d9caa8c9d\" title=\"62-df-ACA0\">62-df-ACA0</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"cfaecdc022e51c90\" href=\"?note=cfaecdc022e51c90\" title=\"62-df-ATR0\">62-df-ATR0</a>；Cn 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"781620ab41bfeebd\" href=\"?note=781620ab41bfeebd\" title=\"62-df-equivalence-over-base\">62-df-equivalence-over-base</a>；ARITH 模型分离见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"20465fe6fc759475\" href=\"?note=20465fe6fc759475\" title=\"62-ex-ARITH-not-ATR\">62-ex-ARITH-not-ATR</a>。</p>\n<p>上游理论为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ACA}_0,\\mathrm{ATR}_0\">\\(\\mathrm{ACA}_0,\\mathrm{ATR}_0\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ACA\\text{-}ATR\\text{-}proper}\\vdash\\;\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{ACA}_0)\\subsetneq\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{ATR}_0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ACA\\text{-}ATR\\text{-}proper}\\vdash\\;\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{ACA}_0)\\subsetneq\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{ATR}_0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>包含由 ATR₀ 的定义给出；严格性由 ARITH 的单个沿自然数序迭代跳跃的 ATR 实例失败给出。存在每个单独有限跳跃，与存在统一编码所有阶段的集不能互换。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Proposition V.2.5；纸面页 175；PDF 页 193。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-ACA0","status":"resolved","id":"35af454d9caa8c9d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-ACA0]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-ATR0","status":"resolved","